      "role": "prompt",
      "prompt": "Mount the fictional event packet. Build a self-contained runnable artifact with no network calls or external media.\n\nRead fixtures/event.json and build a complete responsive result surface as index.html. It must let a reviewer enter waiting, connection-interrupted, sealed, reveal, and selected states without reloading. Treat the drawing as a room of people awaiting one consequential moment, not as a metrics dashboard. Derive a visual register from the event instead of using supplied style adjectives. Motion, copy, type, and sound-free feedback may be expressive when they clarify state. Each state container must expose its key as data-state, and every state must remain distinct under prefers-reduced-motion. Do not invent money, gambling, accounts, or prizes beyond the packet.",
